# Secrets for the Proxmox stack — the repo is PUBLIC (ADR 0017).
#
# The only versioned secrets file is the ENCRYPTED `secrets.env.sops`.
# Anything that could be in cleartext stays out of git, including the intermediate
# `secrets.env` that SOPS reads before encrypting (the root .gitignore covers
# `.env`, but would NOT cover `secrets.env`).

.env
env.defaults
secrets.env
secrets.env.decrypted
*.env.plain

# age keys never enter the repo (the private one lives in /etc/nora/age.key).
*.age
*.agekey
age.key

# Explicit reinforcement that the examples MUST be versioned.
!.env.example
!secrets.env.example
!secrets.env.sops
